{"id":"wb-3-146","name":"崇觉寺铁塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"崇觉寺铁塔","text":"崇觉寺铁塔位于中国山东省济宁市任城区济宁博物馆内（原铁塔寺街铁塔寺），1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n铁塔寺原名崇觉寺，始建于北齐皇建元年（560年），历代均有重修。北宋崇宁四年（1105年）建铁塔，当时建塔没有铸顶，明万历九年（1581年）增建塔身二级和鎏金塔刹，全塔告成。铁塔为楼阁式，八角九级，通高23.8米，下部为砖砌八角形基座。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B4%87%E8%A7%89%E5%AF%BA%E9%93%81%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86856403,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856403","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/220d653fb23f8db356737eb6.jpg","title":"Jining_Chongjue_Si_Tieta_2015.08.13_17-33-02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jining_Chongjue_Si_Tieta_2015.08.13_17-33-02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/Jining_Chongjue_Si_Tieta_2015.08.13_17-33-02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"济宁博物馆崇觉寺铁塔和声远楼","width":320,"height":213}}